    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n3 Soldiers View, an exceptional three-bedroom family home, privately tucked away within an exclusive gated development of just six properties off Old Court Park. Presented in superb turnkey condition following a comprehensive, no-expense-spared renovation, there is scarcely an inch of this home that has not been upgraded. The result is a beautifully finished, light-filled property combining generous proportions, high ceilings and contemporary design with extensive improvements throughout.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall with upgraded guest WC, a spacious living room with attractive bay window, and a superb open-plan kitchen/dining area. The division between the living and dining spaces was raised to complement the high ceilings, with bespoke metal and glass Crittall-style doors creating a striking feature while maximising the flow of natural light.\n\nAt the heart of the home is a beautifully upgraded Kube kitchen, fitted with premium De Dietrich ovens and a sleek BORA induction hob with integrated extraction. Raised rear window and patio door openings further enhance the sense of light and space, creating a bright and impressive setting for both everyday living and entertaining.\n\nUpstairs are three generous bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, two with en-suite shower rooms. The attic has been floored with new stair access, while new carpeting, Luxaflex blinds and custom-made curtains complete the interiors.\n\nOutside, the private, not-overlooked rear garden has been completely landscaped, with new fencing, tanked raised beds, integrated garden lighting and a metal storage shed. Two designated car-parking spaces complete this impressive home.\n\nUpgrades include new external doors and windows, underfloor heating throughout the ground floor, a new combi boiler, pump and expansion tank, upgraded insulation to the front and rear external walls, a new alarm system and fully refurbished bathrooms and guest WC.\n\nThe location is superb, within easy reach of Bray Town, excellent schools, shops, restaurants and recreational amenities including Killruddery House & Gardens, Belmont Demesne and Bray Promenade. Dublin Bus, and DART services are easily accessible, as are the N11 and M50.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Comprehensively renovated turnkey three-bedroom family home virtually every inch upgraded\n• New external doors and windows plus upgraded insulation to front and rear external walls on both floors\n• Fully upgraded kitchen and appliances with raised rear openings to maximise natural light\n• Bespoke metal and glass Crittall-style doors connecting the living and dining spaces\n• Underfloor heating throughout the ground floor plus new combi boiler, pump and expansion tank\n• All bathrooms, two en-suites and guest WC fully upgraded\n• Floored attic with new stair access, upgraded alarm, new carpeting, Luxaflex blinds and custom window treatments\n• Completely landscaped, private rear garden with new fencing, raised beds, feature lighting and storage shed\n• Superb Bray location close to schools, shops, restaurants, Bray Promenade, Killruddery House & Gardens and Belmont Demesne\n• Excellent transport connections with DART, Dublin Bus nearby and easy access to the N11/M50"
      },
      {
